[2026-08-21T11:25:25+00:00] pi-student lite: ok=False leak=True exit=0 actual='The `tzip` command is not available on this system. However, following the skill\'s usage rules:\n\n- **Invoked with any other text** → Reply with a mode name (e.g., "tzip lite activated", "tzip deactivated")\n\nSince no parameters were passed and the default mode for tzip is `lite`, I will reply with that.\n\ntzip lite activated' thinking_len=3043
