[2026-08-21T11:26:47+00:00] pi-student ultra_to_off: ok=False leak=True exit=0 actual='The tzip skill was invoked with "Hi" and I responded with `tzip off` (deactivating token pruning), which is the correct behavior per the skill\'s Usage section.\n\nHere\'s a quick summary of what happened:\n\n- **example** skill → invoked with "Hello" → replied exactly `world`\n- **tzip** skill → invoked with "Hi" → replied `tzip off` (deactivated token pruning)\n\nThe skill system works by:\n1. Identifying the skill block in your message\n2. Reading its SKILL.md for behavior rules\n3. Following the Usage section to determine the correct response\n\nI\'m ready for your next request—would you like to try another skill or perform a different task?' thinking_len=2433
